        <p><seg source="#source-16514-16535">飛びもあへなく</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-16535-16559"><rb>耽溺</rb><rt>たんでき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-16559-16588">のくるひにぞ入る。</seg></p>
        <p><seg source="#source-16588-16600">薄ら闇、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-16600-16621"><rb>盲唖</rb><rt>まうあ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-16621-16624">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-16624-16639"><rb>院</rb><rt>ゐん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-16639-16642">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-16642-16672"><rb>角硝子</rb><rt>かくがらす</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-16672-16697">暗くかがやく。</seg></p>
