        <p><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-17780-17801"><rb>濃霧</rb><rt>のうむ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-17801-17819">はそそぐ……</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-17819-17834"><rb>数</rb><rt>かず</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-17834-17872">の、見よ、人かげうごき、</seg></p>
        <p><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-17872-17884"><rb>闌</rb><rt>ふ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-17884-17890">くる</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-17890-17902"><rb>夜</rb><rt>よ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-17902-17905">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-17905-17926"><rb>恐怖</rb><rt>おそれ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-17926-17932">か、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-17932-17947"><rb>痛</rb><rt>いた</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-17947-17967">きわななきに</seg></p>
