        <p><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-18056-18077"><rb>盲目</rb><rt>めしひ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-18077-18086">弾き、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-18086-18104"><rb>唖</rb><rt>おうし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-18104-18107">と</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-18107-18131"><rb>聾者</rb><rt>ろうじや</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-18131-18146"><rb>円</rb><rt>つぶ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-18146-18149">ら</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-18149-18161"><rb>眼</rb><rt>め</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-18161-18164">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-18164-18179"><rb>重</rb><rt>かさ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-18179-18185">なり</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-18185-18200"><rb>覗</rb><rt>のぞ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-18200-18210">く。</seg></p>
