        <p><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-18598-18619"><rb>濃霧</rb><rt>のうむ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-18619-18637">はそそぐ……</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-18637-18649"><rb>香</rb><rt>か</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-18649-18652">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-18652-18676"><rb>腐蝕</rb><rt>ふしよく</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-18676-18679">、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-18679-18694"><rb>肉</rb><rt>にく</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-18694-18697">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-18697-18721"><rb>衰頽</rb><rt>すゐたい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-18721-18732">、――</seg></p>
