        <p><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-47316-47328"><rb>吹</rb><rt>ふ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-47328-47346">き鳴らす古き</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-47346-47367"><rb>舞楽</rb><rt>ぶがく</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-47367-47370">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-47370-47385"><rb>笙</rb><rt>せう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-47385-47388">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-47388-47403"><rb>節</rb><rt>ふし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-47403-47408">、</seg></p>
