        <p><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-48151-48163"><rb>舞</rb><rt>ま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-48163-48169">へる</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-48169-48187"><rb>思</rb><rt>おもひ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-48187-48192">の</seg></p>
