      <div>
        <p><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-48432-48447"><rb>今</rb><rt>いま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-48447-48453">しも</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-48453-48468"><rb>街</rb><rt>まち</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-48468-48471">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-48471-48486"><rb>空</rb><rt>そら</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-48486-48501"><rb>高</rb><rt>たか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-48501-48504">く</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-48504-48516"><rb>消</rb><rt>き</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-48516-48522">ゆる</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-48522-48540"><rb>光</rb><rt>ひかり</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-48540-48563">のわななきに、</seg></p>
