        <p><seg source="#source-48688-48697">また、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-48697-48709"><rb>浮</rb><rt>う</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-48709-48721">きのこる</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-48721-48751"><rb>鬱金香</rb><rt>うこんかう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-48751-48754">。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-48754-48766"><rb>暮</rb><rt>く</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-48766-48772">れて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-48772-48784"><rb>果</rb><rt>は</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-48784-48793">てたる</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-48793-48817"><rb>白牛</rb><rt>しろうし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-48817-48822">の</seg></p>
